    "body": "Stopped work on this issue because `sccache` blocked the final gate runs (`Connection refused` on `rustc -vV`).\n\nWhat is ready on local commit `e01122483` (branch `issue/1445-fine-boring-and-g89` in `.claude/worktrees/issue-1445`):\n- `BackBore` (`G89`) keeps bottom dwell and retracts by `MoveKind::Feed` at `plunge_feed`.\n- `CycleKind::FineBore` adds `shift: [f64; 2]` in `cl::Cycle` and `cnc::CycleRec`, with WCS flip and yaw support.\n- `validate_shift`, `wall_clearance_clash`, and `fine_bore_gate` enforce fine-bore shift direction and cutter or shank wall clearance.\n- `Machine.spindle_orientation` (`Option<bool>`) and `spindle_orientation_gate` refuse `FineBore` when explicitly `false`.\n- All 14 post scripts either emit `G76` / `G202` or refuse `FINEBORE` by name.\n- `verify::acquit_by_prior` acquits `FineBore` clearance rapids (`first_move + 1` and `first_move + 3`) only over cleared prior columns via `prior_capsule_surface`.\n\nChecks observed before the final two test-file clippy edits:\n- `camcraft-cl --lib fine_bore`: 1 passed, 0 failed.\n- `camcraft-motion --lib`: 460 passed, 0 failed, 10 ignored.\n- `camcraft-post --test backbore_cycle --test fine_bore_cycle --test machine_check`: 11 passed (1, 4, 6), 0 failed.\n- `camcraft-sim --lib verify::prior`: 13 passed, 0 failed.\n- `camcraft-app --test fine_bore_cycle`: 7 passed, 0 failed.\n- Mutation checks on `cycle.rs`, `fine_bore.rs`, `gates.rs`, `judge.rs`, `heidenhain.cps`, and `prior.rs`: all went red when mutated and green after restore.\n- Golden diff against `upstream/main`: 13 new `.nc` files under `crates/post/tests/golden/backbore/` and `crates/post/tests/golden/fine_bore/`, 0 existing goldens changed.\n\nChecks after the final edit (`crates/post/tests/fine_bore_cycle.rs` and `crates/app/tests/fine_bore_cycle/gates.rs`):\n- `cargo clippy` (`--all-targets -- -D warnings` on `camcraft-cl`, `camcraft-motion`, `camcraft-post`, `camcraft-sim`, `camcraft-app`, `camcraft-ui`): passed.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`, `cargo xtask gate heavy --base upstream/main`, and test re-runs on head `e01122483`: blocked before execution by `sccache: error: Connection to server timed out: Os { code: 111, kind: ConnectionRefused, message: \"Connection refused\" }`.\n\nRemoving label `claimed`. The branch is held locally and is not pushed.\n",
