    "body": "fix on issue/1445-fine-boring · PR #2893 · pinned by drilling::tests_fine_bore (camcraft-motion), fine_bore_cycle (camcraft-post, camcraft-app), verify::fine_bore (camcraft-sim), egui_app::tests::cycle_combo and egui_app::tests::holes_fine_bore (camcraft-ui) · merges at the next cut\n\nThis is the last slice of this issue: fine boring (G76), the work of #1479. The PR is stacked on #2823 (Back bore, G89). Merge #2823 first.\n\n- Haas writes `G76 X Y Z R I J P F`. Each other shipped post refuses the cycle by name.\n- The work for the other controls is in #2886.\n- No literature search ran: the session had no web access. The PR body says what a reviewer must check.\n- No heavy lane ran. The PR body says so.\n",
